# Galaxy satellite bang

New home satellites belong in `SATELLITE_SEEDS` inside `src/lib/nav.ts`. Orbit `start` / `rest` are computed from the list length so every satellite gets the same 1.6s delay, 1.5s arrive/grow, and one orbit lap. Do not wrap those angles into 0–360; wrapping makes a satellite skip the lap (學而 did this).

Do not add per-id bang or float CSS such as `.sat-notes`. Home already maps `SATELLITES` and `.sat` / `.orb-sat` run the explosion.

Also add the module to `View`, `MODULES`, and `App` routing. Keep general chat models out of 智能.
